{"id":2123,"level":79,"name":"Зв’язка 1","group":"Опануй зв’язку","format":27,"description":"<p><span style='font-weight: 400;'>The pin is a dangerous weapon. Yet a pin by itself does not always automatically win material. But a pinned piece is vulnerable because it cannot move. By increasing the pressure on the pinned piece with an additional attacker, it may be possible to win material.</span></p>  <p></p>  <p><b>What do you have to do?&nbsp;</b></p>  <p><span style='font-weight: 400;'>Win material by attacking a pinned piece.&nbsp;</span></p>","assignment":"","stickerID":91,"examples":[{"fen":"2kr4/1pp2p2/p2p4/3Qnqp1/4p3/P3P2r/1PP1BP2/2KR2R1 w - - 0 22","pgn":"{[%evp 0,3,375,373,1058,1033]} 22. Bg4 Nxg4 23. Qxf5+ * ","text":"<p>Білі можуть скористатися двома зв’язками з:<strong> 1.Bg4! </strong>Якщо чорні зараз беруть конем, білі виграють ферзя за горизонтальну зв’язки.</p>","format":27}],"puzzles":[{"id":78228,"fen":"8/1p1n2bk/pP1q2n1/2NPp3/1Q2Pp1p/1N1B1PpP/6P1/5K2 b - - 0 40","pgn":"{[%csl Rb4,Rc5][%evp 0,1,-216,-209]} {Q=1} 40... Bf8 * ","format":27,"texts":["Спробуйте посилити наявну зв’язку."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":78234,"fen":"3r4/3r2p1/R3pp1p/8/P4kP1/BP2n2P/8/4R1K1 w - - 0 40","pgn":"{[%csl Re3,Rf4][%evp 0,3,258,268,272,275]} {Q=1} 40. Bc1 Rd1  41. Bxe3+ * ","format":27,"texts":["фігури на одній діагоналі пропонують тактичні можливості."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":78229,"fen":"r4rk1/1p2bppp/p1n1bn2/3pN3/2pP1P2/2N1B1P1/PqPQ2BP/R4RK1 b - - 0 15","pgn":"{[%csl Rc3,Rd2][%evp 0,3,-316,-316,-374,-277]} {Q=1} 15... Bb4 16. Rab1 {Q=2} Qxc3 * ","format":27,"texts":["фігури на одній діагоналі пропонують тактичні можливості.","Виберіть найкращий знімок."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":78231,"fen":"r1b2r2/6kp/pq4p1/1pb1Pp2/3N1P2/1B6/PP1Q2PP/3R1R1K b - - 0 24","pgn":"{[%csl Rd2,Rd4][%evp 0,5,-13,-23,-23,-14,-14,-29]} {Q=1} 24... Rd8 25. Bd5 {Q=2} Rxd5 26. Nxf5+ {Q=3} Bxf5 * ","format":27,"texts":["фігури на од